<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %> | Artigos LIGEM</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #08111f, #0f172a 48%, #101827); color: #e2e8f0; min-height: 100vh; }
    .topbar { background: rgba(15,23,42,0.8); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.1); backdrop-filter: blur(20px); padding: 0 2rem; height: 64px; display: flex; align-items: center; }
    .topbar-inner { width: 100%; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
    .logo { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: #e2e8f0; text-decoration: none; }
    .main-content { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 3rem 1.5rem; }
    .hero { margin-bottom: 1.75rem; text-align: center; }
    .hero h1 { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 800; color: #f8fafc; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
    .hero p { color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .card { background: rgba(15,23,42,0.78); border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.14); border-radius: 18px; padding: 2rem; box-shadow: 0 24px 80px rgba(2,6,23,0.35); }
    .note { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; padding: 1rem 1.1rem; border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(59,130,246,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(96,165,250,0.2); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.65; }
    .alert { padding: 0.9rem 1rem; border-radius: 10px; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .alert-error { background: rgba(239,68,68,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(248,113,113,0.25); color: #fca5a5; }
    .alert-success { background: rgba(34,197,94,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(74,222,128,0.2); color: #86efac; }
    .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; }
    .form-group { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .form-group label { display: block; color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.45rem; }
    .form-group input { width: 100%; padding: 0.8rem 0.95rem; border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.2); border-radius: 10px; background: rgba(2,6,23,0.35); color: #f8fafc; font-size: 0.95rem; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }
    .form-group input:focus { outline: none; border-color: #60a5fa; box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(59,130,246,0.16); }
    .password-field { position: relative; }
    .password-field input { padding-right: 3.25rem; }
    .toggle-password { position: absolute; right: 0.8rem; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); background: transparent; border: none; color: #94a3b8; cursor: pointer; font-size: 1rem; }
    .actions { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
    .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 0.8rem 1.2rem; border-radius: 10px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; border: none; cursor: pointer; }
    .btn-primary { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #0ea5e9); color: white; }
    .btn-secondary { background: transparent; color: #cbd5e1; border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.2); }
    footer { text-align: center; padding: 2rem; color: #64748b; font-size: 0.75rem; }
    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .actions { flex-direction: column-reverse; align-items: stretch; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="topbar">
    <div class="topbar-inner">
      <a href="/" class="logo">Artigos LIGEM</a>
      <a href="/login" class="btn btn-secondary" style="padding:0.55rem 0.85rem;">Entrar</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="main-content">
    <div class="hero">
      <h1>Solicitar Cadastro</h1>
      <p>Preencha seus dados para solicitar acesso ao sistema. O cadastro ficará pendente até a validação por um administrador.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="note">
        Após o envio, sua conta ficará em análise. O acesso ao sistema só será liberado depois da aprovação administrativa.
      </div>

      <% if (error) { %>
        <div class="alert alert-error"><%= error %></div>
      <% } %>
      <% if (success) { %>
        <div class="alert alert-success"><%= success %></div>
      <% } %>

      <form method="POST" action="/cadastro">
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="name">Nome completo *</label>
          <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required value="<%= formData.name || '' %>">
        </div>

        <div class="grid">
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="email">E-mail *</label>
            <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required value="<%= formData.email || '' %>" autocomplete="username">
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="institution">Instituição</label>
            <input type="text" id="institution" name="institution" value="<%= formData.institution || '' %>">
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid">
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="cpf">CPF</label>
            <input type="text" id="cpf" name="cpf" value="<%= formData.cpf || '' %>">
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="passport">Passaporte</label>
            <input type="text" id="passport" name="passport" value="<%= formData.passport || '' %>">
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="country">País</label>
          <input type="text" id="country" name="country" value="<%= formData.country || '' %>">
        </div>

        <div class="grid">
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="password">Senha *</label>
            <div class="password-field">
              <input type="password" id="password" name="password" required minlength="6" autocomplete="new-password">
              <button type="button" class="toggle-password" aria-label="Mostrar senha" data-target="password">👁</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="confirm_password">Confirmar senha *</label>
            <div class="password-field">
              <input type="password" id="confirm_password" name="confirm_password" required minlength="6" autocomplete="new-password">
              <button type="button" class="toggle-password" aria-label="Mostrar senha" data-target="confirm_password">👁</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="actions">
          <a href="/" class="btn btn-secondary">Voltar ao início</a>
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Enviar Solicitação</button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer>&copy; <%= year %> LIGEM.Redes</footer>
  <script>
    document.querySelectorAll('.toggle-password').forEach(function(button) {
      button.addEventListener('click', function() {
        var input = document.getElementById(button.getAttribute('data-target'));
        var showing = input.type === 'text';
        input.type = showing ? 'password' : 'text';
        button.textContent = showing ? '👁' : '🙈';
        button.setAttribute('aria-label', showing ? 'Mostrar senha' : 'Ocultar senha');
      });
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>
